  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Core Types**\n\nI\'ve started defining the core TypeScript types. Currently, I have `NavigationTab` to cover all navigation options and `ProjectHealth`, encompassing the overall percentage and status. This is the foundation upon which the rest of the architecture will be built, ensuring type safety and clarity.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Structures**\n\nI\'m now expanding the data structures to capture more specific aspects. I\'ve defined `ScopeFeature`, `Idea`, `Task`, `TeamMember`, and `Resource`. I\'m currently working on `JudgeEvaluation` and `LaunchItem` to round out these critical data models, considering their unique attributes and relationships. I\'m focusing on ensuring each structure is comprehensive and supports accurate data representation.\n\n\n**Defining Activity Logs**\n\nI\'ve defined `ActivityLog` to track events, including `id`, `message`, `timestamp`, and `type`, using a specified set of types like \'ai\' and \'dashboard\'. I\'m also ensuring the structure supports capturing diverse interactions within the system, like those from a scope builder or judge. I\'m focusing on providing robust data for effective monitoring and analysis.\n\n\n**Developing Core Features**\n\nI\'m now outlining key features, including an MVP planner with stage movements and a task board with an active timer. I\'m also planning AI-driven resource pressure assessment with real advice, and a judge simulator with detailed breakdowns and interactive fixes. A launch checklist and ship mode modal are also in the works. I\'m focusing on user interaction to provide an effective, efficient experience.\n\n\n\n**Designing Ship Mode**\n\nI\'ve been designing the dramatic and triumphant Ship Mode view. I\'ve broken it down into components, with `/src/components/overview/OverviewDashboard.tsx` being the main focus, encompassing a Hero section, Radial Health visualization, Time Pressure visualizer, AI Recommendation panel, and interactive elements. I\'m also planning the `/src/components/ideas/IdeaLab.tsx`, `/src/components/mvp/MVPPlanner.tsx`, `/src/components/tasks/TaskBoard.tsx`, and `/src/components/resources/ResourcesView.tsx`. The goal is to make it interactive with key data.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 139780049
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
