r\'>Halftime Rec</span> </div> </div> <div class=\'max-w-[420px]\'> <h3 class=\'text-xs font-bold text-[#A8E6CF] uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\'>Intelligent Correction</h3> <p class=\'text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-white mb-6\'> \\\"You\'re <span class=\'text-[#FFB7B2]\'>3 hours over capacity</span>. Cut analytics and team profiles. Finish the core AI evaluation flow first.\\\" </p> <div class=\'flex space-x-4\'> <button class=\'bg-[#C7F9A6] text-[#202B2A] font-bold text-xs px-6 py-3 rounded-xl hover:opacity-90 transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(199,249,166,0.2)]\'>RECALCULATE PLAN</button> <button class=\'bg-white/10 text-white font-bold text-xs px-6 py-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/20\'>VIEW REASONING</button> </div> </div> <div class=\'absolute bottom-[-40px] right-[-20px] opacity-10 pointer-events-none\'> <svg width=\'200\' height=\'200\' viewBox=\'0 0 200 200\'> <circle cx=\'100\' cy=\'100\' r=\'80\' stroke=\'#A8E6CF\' stroke-width=\'1\' fill=\'none\' stroke-dasharray=\'10 5\' /> <circle cx=\'100\' cy=\'100\' r=\'60\' stroke=\'#A8E6CF\' stroke-width=\'0.5\' fill=\'none\' /> </svg> </div> </div> <div class=\'col-span-5 row-span-3 bg-[#293735] rounded-[32px] p-6 border border-[#3B4B47] flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-[#71817B] mb-4\'>Your Next Move</span> <div class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\'> <div class=\'flex items-start mb-4\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 bg-[#FFB7B2]/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mr-4 shrink-0 border border-[#FFB7B2]/30\'> <svg width=\'20\' height=\'20\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'#FFB7B2\' stroke-width=\'2.5\' stroke-linecap=\'round\' stroke-linejoin=\'round\'><path d=\'M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83\'/></svg> </div> <div> <h4 class=\'font-bold text-xl leading-tight mb-1\'>Finish the core AI evaluation flow</h4> <div class=\'flex items-center space-x-3\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] bg-[#FFB7B2] text-[#202B2A] font-black px-2 py-0.5 rounded\'>CRITICAL</span> <span class=\'text-xs font-mono text-[#AAB8B2]\'>1h 20m est.</span> </div> </div> </div> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#71817B] mb-6 leading-relaxed\'> \\\"Everything else depends on this workflow. Without this, your demo has no anchor.\\\" </p> <button class=\'w-full border-2 border-[#C7F9A6] text-[#C7F9A6] font-black text-xs py-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-[#C7F9A6] hover:text-[#202B2A] transition-all tracking-widest\'>START TASK \342\206\222</button> </div> </div> <div class=\'col-span-7 row-span-3 bg-[#202B2A] rounded-[32px] p-8 border border-[#3B4B47] shadow-inner relative\'> <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between mb-8\'> <div class=\'flex items-center space-x-3\'> <span class=\'text-xl\'>\342\234\202\357\270\217</span> <h3 class=\'text-lg font-bold tracking-tight\'>Scope Cutter</h3> </div> <div class=\'text-right\'> <p class=\'text-[9px] text-[#71817B] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest\'>Recoverable</p> <p class=\'text-xl font-mono font-bold text-[#A8DADC]\'>03:45:00</p> </div> </div> <div class=\'space-y-3\'> <div class=\'group flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-[#293735] rounded-2xl border border-transparent hover:border-[#FFB7B2]/30 transition-all cursor-pointer\'> <div class=\'flex items-center space-x-4\'> <div class=\'w-5 h-5 rounded border-2 border-[#FFB7B2] flex items-center justify-center\'> <div class=\'w-2.5 h-0.5 bg-[#FFB7B2]\'></div> </div> <span class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Analytics Dashboard</span> </div> <span class=\'text-xs font-mono text-[#71817B] group-hover:text-[#FFB7B2]\'>- 2h 00m</span> </div> <div class=\'group flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-[#293735] rounded-2xl border border-transparent hover:border-[#FFB7B2]/30 transition-all cursor-pointer\'> <div class=\'flex items-center space-x-4\'> <div class=\'w-5 h-5 rounded border-2 border-[#FFB7B2] flex items-center justify-center\'> <div class=\'w-2.5 h-0.5 bg-[#FFB7B2]\'></div> </div> <span class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Team Public Profiles</span> </div> <span class=\'text-xs font-mono text-[#71817B] group-hover:text-[#FFB7B2]\'>- 1h 00m</span> </div> <div class=\'group flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-[#293735] rounded-2xl border border-transparent hover:border-[#FFB7B2]/30 transition-all cursor-pointer opacity-60\'> <div class=\'flex items-center space-x-4\'> <div class=\'w-5 h-5 rounded border-2 border-[#3B4B47] flex items-center justify-center\'></div> <span class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Dark Mode Toggle</span> </div> <span class=\'text-xs font-mono text-[#71817B]\'>- 45m</span> </div> </div> <div class=\'mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-[#3B4B47] flex items-center justify-between\'> <p class=\'text-[10px] text-[#71817B] max-w-[200px]\'>Removing non-essential features recovers time without hurting the final demo score.</p> <button class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-[#FFB7B2] uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-[#FFB7B2] pb-1 hover:pb-2 transition-all\'>Execute Cuts</button> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class=\'absolute bottom-8 right-8 z-50 flex space-x-3\'> <div class=\'bg-[#293735]/80 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-white/5 flex items-center space-x-3 shadow-2xl\'> <span class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#A8E6CF]\'></span> <span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold tracking-tight\'>AI ONLINE</span> </div> <div class=\'bg-[#C7F9A6] text-[#202B2A] w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(199,249,166,0.4)] cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform\'> <span class=\'text-xs font-black\'>\342\214\230K</span> </div> </div> </main> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Artistic Flair\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Artistic Flair\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#202B2A] text-[#F0F4EE] flex font-sans overflow-hidden select-none\' style=\'font-family: \\\"Inter\\\", \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, sans-serif;\'> <aside class=\'w-64 border-r border-[#3B4B47] flex flex-col bg-[#202B2A] z-20\'> <div class=\'p-8 flex items-center space-x-3\'> <div class=\'relative w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center\'> <div class=\'absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#FFB7B2] via-[#C7F9A6] to-[#A8DADC] rounded-sm opacity-80\'></div> <div class=\'z-10 w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center bg-[#202B2A] scale-90\'> <div class=\'flex space-x-[2px] items-end\'> <div class=\'w-2 h-5 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#FFB7B2] to-[#FFE0A3]\'></div> <div class=\'w-2 h-3 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#A8E6CF] to-[#C7F9A6] mt-2\'></div> <div class=\'w-2 h-5 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#B8DDF0] to-[#CDB4DB]\'></div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <h1 class=\'text-lg font-bold tracking-tight leading-none\'>HALFTIME</h1> <p class=\'text-[9px