    modified_response: "I have upgraded **HALFTIME** into a fully functional and interactive hackathon command center while preserving the existing visual layout and color palette:\n\n- **Working Real-Time Countdown**:\n  - Configured a real-time countdown starting at `31 : 42 : 17` (`TIME LEFT`) that decrements live every second.\n  - Automatically updates visual status indicators between **NORMAL**, **AT RISK**, and **CRITICAL** using the established pastel coral and warning palette.\n\n- **Deterministic Project Time Engine**:\n  - Implemented mathematical capacity calculations where $\\text{capacityGap} = \\text{workRemaining} - \\text{timeAvailable}$.\n  - Dynamically recalculates runway metrics, buffer times, and health percentages across the application.\n\n- **Interactive Scope Cutter**:\n  - Added multi-select checkbox controls for trimming candidate features (*Analytics dashboard*, *Team profiles*, *Dark mode customization*).\n  - Dynamically computes `SELECTED: X features` and `RECOVERABLE: 3h 45m`.\n  - Executing cuts updates total backlog effort from **14h** to **10h 15m**, turns the **3h capacity deficit** into a **45m pitch buffer**, and transitions project health from **72% (AT RISK)** to **94% (ON TRACK)** with celebration feedback and a reset toggle.\n\n- **\"Your Next Move\" Task Runner**:\n  - Interactive task starter for the anchor task (*\"Finish the core AI evaluation flow\"*).\n  - Activating the task transitions its badge to **IN PROGRESS**, starts a live elapsed timer, and appends real-time audit logs.\n\n- **Time vs Work Visualization & Recent Activity**:\n  - Responsive visual progress gauges comparing time available against backlog effort.\n  - Stateful activity timeline that automatically prepends timestamped events upon user interactions."
