  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Server Entry Point**\n\nI\'m now focusing on creating the `server.ts` entry point for the Express application. The initial task is to establish the necessary core features. This includes an Express app with `express.json()` middleware. Currently, I\'m thinking about integrating rate-limiting middleware to manage request counts per IP address within a rolling 1-minute window, aiming for a cap on AI calls at, say, 35 requests per minute, returning a 429 status code on exceeding the limit.\n\n\n"
