    response: "I have completed connecting **HALFTIME** to the Gemini API via a secure server-side architecture while preserving the existing UI design, typography, layout, and color palette.\n\n### What was completed:\n\n- **Server-Side Gemini Architecture**: Implemented a secure Express API server (`/api/ai/*`) that proxies all AI requests and keeps the `GEMINI_API_KEY` hidden from the client.\n- **Centralized Gemini Service**: Built structured JSON generation routines for:\n  - **Idea Generation & Evaluation**: Synthesizing 3\342\200\2235 high-signal hackathon ideas with innovation, feasibility, problem fit, and demo scores, with `BUILD`, `MODIFY`, or `KILL` verdicts.\n  - **MVP Synthesizer**: Prioritizing core MVP loops (`MUST_BUILD`, `SHOULD_BUILD`, `CUT`) constrained to the team\'s remaining runway.\n  - **Judge Simulation**: Calibrating score predictions and actionable fixes against hackathon rubrics (e.g. DoraHacks 2.0).\n  - **Scope Cutter Reasoning**: Explaining capacity gaps and time recovery tradeoffs.\n  - **Pitch Coach**: Generating a structured 7-point judge conversion breakdown and a verbal 60\342\200\22390 second teleprompter script.\n- **Stepped Loading States**: Added stepped visual progress indicators (`\"HALFTIME IS THINKING...\"`) across Idea Lab, MVP Planner, Judge Mode, and Launch Coach views.\n- **Graceful Error Handling & Fallbacks**: Integrated fallback handling so the application remains responsive if the network or API is temporarily unavailable."
    modified_response: "I have completed connecting **HALFTIME** to the Gemini API via a secure server-side architecture while preserving the existing UI design, typography, layout, and color palette.\n\n### What was completed:\n\n- **Server-Side Gemini Architecture**: Implemented a secure Express API server (`/api/ai/*`) that proxies all AI requests and keeps the `GEMINI_API_KEY` hidden from the client.\n- **Centralized Gemini Service**: Built structured JSON generation routines for:\n  - **Idea Generation & Evaluation**: Synthesizing 3\342\200\2235 high-signal hackathon ideas with innovation, feasibility, problem fit, and demo scores, with `BUILD`, `MODIFY`, or `KILL` verdicts.\n  - **MVP Synthesizer**: Prioritizing core MVP loops (`MUST_BUILD`, `SHOULD_BUILD`, `CUT`) constrained to the team\'s remaining runway.\n  - **Judge Simulation**: Calibrating score predictions and actionable fixes against hackathon rubrics (e.g. DoraHacks 2.0).\n  - **Scope Cutter Reasoning**: Explaining capacity gaps and time recovery tradeoffs.\n  - **Pitch Coach**: Generating a structured 7-point judge conversion breakdown and a verbal 60\342\200\22390 second teleprompter script.\n- **Stepped Loading States**: Added stepped visual progress indicators (`\"HALFTIME IS THINKING...\"`) across Idea Lab, MVP Planner, Judge Mode, and Launch Coach views.\n- **Graceful Error Handling & Fallbacks**: Integrated fallback handling so the application remains responsive if the network or API is temporarily unavailable."
