  planner_response {
    response: "### Verification & AI Connection Report\n\nThe end-to-end verification and integration of the Gemini AI connection for **HALFTIME (Hackathon Copilot)** is complete. All existing UI design, typography, spacing, and styling have been strictly preserved.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Checklist\n\n- **\342\234\205 Gemini Connection & Server-Side Security**:\n  - `GEMINI_API_KEY` is isolated to server-side code (`server/geminiService.ts` & `server.ts`) via `process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY`.\n  - No client-side code, React components, `localStorage`, `sessionStorage`, or public bundles contain or expose the key.\n  - All AI operations are proxied through `/api/ai/*` routes.\n\n- **\342\234\205 Structured Output & Strict Schemas**:\n  - Every Gemini request uses `application/json` with defined Type schemas.\n  - All responses are validated with fallbacks and null-safe field guards so unexpected outputs never crash the application.\n\n- **\342\234\205 Idea Lab**:\n  - Pre-seeded with the requested default demo parameters:\n    - **Team skills**: `Frontend development, AI, UI/UX`\n    - **Frustration**: `Teams waste too much time deciding what to build during hackathons.`\n    - **Target users**: `Hackathon teams`\n    - **Available time**: `10 hours`\n  - Generates 3\342\200\2235 high-signal concepts with problem, target user, solution, scores, verdicts (`BUILD`, `MODIFY`, `KILL`), and judge reasoning.\n\n- **\342\234\205 Idea Evaluation (Idea Killer / Validator)**:\n  - Deep critique shows full multi-factor scoring: **Innovation (25%)**, **Problem Fit (20%)**, **Usability**, **Execution**, **Impact**, **Feasibility**, and **Overall Score**.\n  - Provides specific, unvarnished judge feedback under **WHY THIS COULD WIN**, **WHY THIS COULD FAIL**, and **WHAT TO CHANGE**.\n\n- **\342\234\205 MVP Planner**:\n  - Tiers features into **MUST BUILD**, **SHOULD BUILD**, **NICE TO HAVE**, and **CUT**.\n  - Respects remaining runway and provides estimated build times to prevent over-commitment.\n\n- **\342\234\205 Dashboard AI (Recalculate Plan)**:\n  - `RECALCULATE PLAN` sends current project telemetry (runway, backlog, status, team) to Gemini and returns a single, high-priority recommendation (action, priority, estimated time, reason, risk).\n\n- **\342\234\205 Scope Cutter (User Decides, Application Calculates)**:\n  - **Initial State**: `TIME LEFT: 11h`, `WORK: 14h`, `STATUS: AT RISK (72%)`.\n  - **Selected Cuts**: Analytics dashboard (\342\210\2222h), Team profiles (\342\210\2221h), Dark mode customization (\342\210\22245m) = **3h 45m recovered**.\n  - **Resulting State**: `WORK: 10h 15m`, `TIME LEFT: 11h`, `BUFFER: 45m`, `STATUS: ON TRACK (94%)`.\n  - Calculated client-side by `projectEngine.ts` with no reliance on AI math.\n\n- **\342\234\205 Judge Mode**:\n  - Evaluated against the official **DoraHacks 2.0 Rubric**: Innovation 25%, Problem Fit 20%, Usability 20%, Execution 15%, Impact 10%, Feasibility 10%.\n  - Displays predicted overall score, skeptical critique (**WHY YOU MIGHT LOSE**), top risks, and interactive **FIX BEFORE SUBMISSION** recovery levers.\n\n- **\342\234\205 Pitch Coach (Launch View)**:\n  - Generates a 7-point structure (**Problem**, **Why It Matters**, **Solution**, **How It Works**, **Demo Moment**, **Impact**, **Why Now**).\n  - Generates a natural 60\342\200\22390 second teleprompter pitch script with real-time timer tracking and copy-to-clipboard support.\n\n- **\342\234\205 Error Handling & Offline Resilience**:\n  - If network or API limits are hit, the application displays `\"HALFTIME AI is temporarily unavailable.\"`\n  - Countdown timer, tasks, scope engine, state transitions, and navigation continue functioning without disruption.\n\n- **\342\234\205 Demo Data Default**:\n  - **Team**: DOOM\n  - **Hackathon**: DoraHacks 2.0\n  - **Project**: Hackathon Copilot\n  - **Time Left**: 11h\n  - **Work Remaining**: 14h\n  - **Project Health**: 72%\n  - **Status**: AT RISK\n\n---\n\n### Remaining Problems:\n- **None**: All TypeScript checks, build steps, and API endpoints passed cleanly with zero compiler or runtime errors."
