    response: "### Production Hardening & Demo Readiness Report\n\nAll verifications, production builds, and demo flows for **HALFTIME (Hackathon Copilot)** have completed with zero build or runtime errors.\n\n---\n\n### Status Matrix\n\n- **BUILD STATUS**: `PASS` \342\200\224 TypeScript, Vite frontend bundle (`dist/`), and Node Express backend server bundle cleanly with zero compilation warnings or type errors.\n- **API STATUS**: `PASS` \342\200\224 Full-stack Express server routes (`/api/health`, `/api/ai/*`) are mounted and responding with structured JSON.\n- **GEMINI STATUS**: `CONNECTED & SECURED` \342\200\224 Server-side Gemini service handles structured generation and evaluation with lazy initialization and strict error guards.\n- **DASHBOARD STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 Health gauge (72% at-risk), countdown timer, live task tracking, and next move recommendations render deterministically.\n- **SCOPE CUTTER STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 The golden-path cut sequence (Analytics, Team Profiles, Dark Mode) seamlessly recovers **3h 45m**, advancing project health to **94% (ON TRACK)** with 45m buffer.\n- **JUDGE MODE STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 DoraHacks 2.0 weighted rubric scoring (Innovation 25%, Problem Fit 20%, Usability 20%, Execution 15%, Impact 10%, Feasibility 10%) dynamically updates based on applied fixes.\n- **PITCH COACH STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 7-point judge conversion breakdown and verbal 60\342\200\22390s demo teleprompter with one-click clipboard copy.\n- **MOBILE STATUS**: `PASS` \342\200\224 Tested across 375px, 768px, and 1440px viewport breakpoints with responsive mobile drawer navigation and touch-accessible controls.\n- **ERROR HANDLING STATUS**: `PASS` \342\200\224 Gracefully catches rate limits, timeouts, or simulated failures without crashing; falls back with clear status feedback (`\"HALFTIME AI is temporarily unavailable. Your project data is safe.\"`).\n- **SECURITY STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 `GEMINI_API_KEY` resides strictly on the server-side environment (`process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY`) and is never leaked to client bundles or browser storage.\n\n---\n\n### Preserved Demo Data\n\n- **Team**: DOOM\n- **Hackathon**: DoraHacks 2.0\n- **Project**: Hackathon Copilot\n- **Time Left**: 11h\n- **Work Remaining**: 14h\n- **Project Health**: 72%\n- **Status**: AT RISK\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n\n**READY FOR DEPLOYMENT**"
    modified_response: "### Production Hardening & Demo Readiness Report\n\nAll verifications, production builds, and demo flows for **HALFTIME (Hackathon Copilot)** have completed with zero build or runtime errors.\n\n---\n\n### Status Matrix\n\n- **BUILD STATUS**: `PASS` \342\200\224 TypeScript, Vite frontend bundle (`dist/`), and Node Express backend server bundle cleanly with zero compilation warnings or type errors.\n- **API STATUS**: `PASS` \342\200\224 Full-stack Express server routes (`/api/health`, `/api/ai/*`) are mounted and responding with structured JSON.\n- **GEMINI STATUS**: `CONNECTED & SECURED` \342\200\224 Server-side Gemini service handles structured generation and evaluation with lazy initialization and strict error guards.\n- **DASHBOARD STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 Health gauge (72% at-risk), countdown timer, live task tracking, and next move recommendations render deterministically.\n- **SCOPE CUTTER STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 The golden-path cut sequence (Analytics, Team Profiles, Dark Mode) seamlessly recovers **3h 45m**, advancing project health to **94% (ON TRACK)** with 45m buffer.\n- **JUDGE MODE STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 DoraHacks 2.0 weighted rubric scoring (Innovation 25%, Problem Fit 20%, Usability 20%, Execution 15%, Impact 10%, Feasibility 10%) dynamically updates based on applied fixes.\n- **PITCH COACH STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 7-point judge conversion breakdown and verbal 60\342\200\22390s demo teleprompter with one-click clipboard copy.\n- **MOBILE STATUS**: `PASS` \342\200\224 Tested across 375px, 768px, and 1440px viewport breakpoints with responsive mobile drawer navigation and touch-accessible controls.\n- **ERROR HANDLING STATUS**: `PASS` \342\200\224 Gracefully catches rate limits, timeouts, or simulated failures without crashing; falls back with clear status feedback (`\"HALFTIME AI is temporarily unavailable. Your project data is safe.\"`).\n- **SECURITY STATUS**: `VERIFIED` \342\200\224 `GEMINI_API_KEY` resides strictly on the server-side environment (`process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY`) and is never leaked to client bundles or browser storage.\n\n---\n\n### Preserved Demo Data\n\n- **Team**: DOOM\n- **Hackathon**: DoraHacks 2.0\n- **Project**: Hackathon Copilot\n- **Time Left**: 11h\n- **Work Remaining**: 14h\n- **Project Health**: 72%\n- **Status**: AT RISK\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n\n**READY FOR DEPLOYMENT**"
