    modified_response: "I have upgraded **HALFTIME** from a single-demo prototype into a multi-user hackathon copilot with persistent project management, dedicated demo mode, and Supabase integration:\n\n- **First-Time User Onboarding**: Created a project initiation screen (**\"WELCOME TO HALFTIME\"**) that captures project details, hackathon name, customizable sprint deadline, and problem description, with instant transitions to either a fresh workspace or the sample demo.\n- **Dedicated Demo Mode**: Preserved the original **Team DOOM / DoraHacks 2.0** walkthrough as a distinct, labeled demo sandbox, complete with high-visibility **DEMO MODE** indicators.\n- **Multi-Project Isolation & Switching**: Added a project switcher allowing builders to maintain multiple hackathons concurrently, isolate backlog tasks, MVP features, and judge evaluations per project.\n- **Dynamic Deadline & Capacity Engine**: Replaced static countdowns with real-time deadline timers that compute available runway, capacity gaps, and health scores tailored to each project\'s actual timeline.\n- **Database Architecture & Supabase Service**: Configured Supabase integration with Row Level Security (RLS) policies and storage synchronization with local persistence fallbacks."
