    thinking: "**Verifying User Interaction**\n\nOkay, here\'s the current state of things: I\'m focusing on user interaction within `OverviewDashboard.tsx`. Specifically, I\'m ensuring the \"Recalculate Plan\" button correctly triggers `onRecalculatePlan`. Further, I am making sure that `onRecalculatePlan` in `App.tsx` correctly calls `recommendNextAction` from Gemini. Now, I\'m checking the code around line 351 in `src/App.tsx`.\n\n\n**Connecting Functionality**\n\nI\'ve been working on integrating the `handleRecalculatePlan` function in `src/App.tsx` with the actual `recommendNextAction` function. I\'m also connecting `AuthModal` with the appropriate states and functions like `isAuthOpen`, `setIsAuthOpen`, and `onOpenAuth`. Finally, I\'m passing full CRUD callbacks to all tabs, ensuring comprehensive functionality across all views.\n\n\n"
