  planner_response {
    response: "I have resolved the duplicate key warning.\n\n### Root Cause\nWhen multiple toast notifications or activity items were dispatched within the same millisecond timestamp, generating IDs strictly using `Date.now()` produced identical keys (e.g. `toast-1787481745230`), triggering React\'s non-unique key warning when rendering `ToastContainer` children.\n\n### Resolution\n- **Guaranteed Unique Toast Keys**: Updated `addToast` in `src/App.tsx` to generate unique keys using a collision-proof pattern combining timestamp and randomized entropy: `toast-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 9)}`.\n- **System-Wide Key Audit**: Updated item and activity log ID generators across `App.tsx`, `LaunchView.tsx`, `IdeaLab.tsx`, `TaskBoard.tsx`, `ResourcesView.tsx`, and `projectStorage.ts` to ensure consistent, collision-free React rendering across all view components."
    modified_response: "I have resolved the duplicate key warning.\n\n### Root Cause\nWhen multiple toast notifications or activity items were dispatched within the same millisecond timestamp, generating IDs strictly using `Date.now()` produced identical keys (e.g. `toast-1787481745230`), triggering React\'s non-unique key warning when rendering `ToastContainer` children.\n\n### Resolution\n- **Guaranteed Unique Toast Keys**: Updated `addToast` in `src/App.tsx` to generate unique keys using a collision-proof pattern combining timestamp and randomized entropy: `toast-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 9)}`.\n- **System-Wide Key Audit**: Updated item and activity log ID generators across `App.tsx`, `LaunchView.tsx`, `IdeaLab.tsx`, `TaskBoard.tsx`, `ResourcesView.tsx`, and `projectStorage.ts` to ensure consistent, collision-free React rendering across all view components."
