  planner_response {
    response: "The Supabase email confirmation user experience for **HALFTIME** has been updated to provide a clear, guidance-oriented authentication flow while preserving Supabase Auth and Row Level Security rules.\n\n---\n\n### **Overview of the Implemented Authentication Flow**\n\n```\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202   SIGN UP    \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Enter email & password (min 6 chars)\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202CREATE ACCOUNT\342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Supabase auth.signUp with emailRedirectTo\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202 CHECK YOUR EMAIL \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Dedicated confirmation screen with email badge,\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230     webmail direct link, spam checklist & resend cooldown\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202 USER CONFIRMS    \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Clicks verification link in email\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202 EMAIL CONFIRMED  \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Redirected back to HALFTIME (cleans hash, verifies session)\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202   SIGN IN    \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Verified login with password\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202HALFTIME DASHBOARD\342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Loads user-isolated projects via Postgres RLS\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n```\n\n---\n\n### **Key Improvements & Implementation Details**\n\n#### **1. Sign-Up Success State (`CHECK YOUR EMAIL`)**\n- Upon calling `supabase.auth.signUp`, HALFTIME inspects `data.session`. When confirmation is required by Supabase, the user is **not** prematurely treated as logged in.\n- The interface automatically transitions to the dedicated confirmation screen:\n  - **Heading:** `CHECK YOUR EMAIL`\n  - **Message:** *\"We\'ve created your HALFTIME account. Please confirm your email address using the link we sent you before signing in.\"*\n  - **Email Badge:** Displays the target email address in a high-contrast monospace container.\n  - **Action Controls:**\n    - `[ OPEN EMAIL ]` / `[ OPEN GMAIL ]` / `[ OPEN OUTLOOK ]`: Smart domain detection opens the user\'s webmail provider in a new tab.\n    - `[ RESEND CONFIRMATION EMAIL ]`: Triggers the live Supabase resend endpoint with an active cooldown timer.\n    - `[ BACK TO SIGN IN ]`: Returns to the sign-in form.\n\n#### **2. Clear Instructions & Unconfirmed Sign-In State**\n- If an unconfirmed user attempts to sign in:\n  - Detects the `email_not_confirmed` error from Supabase.\n  - Replaces raw technical errors with a dedicated `EMAIL NOT CONFIRMED` view stating: *\"Please confirm your email address before signing in.\"*\n  - Provides instant access to `[ RESEND CONFIRMATION EMAIL ]` and `[ TRY AGAIN ]`.\n- Includes an instruction panel:\n  - *\"Didn\'t receive it?\"*\n  - *\"\342\200\242 Check your spam or junk folder.\"*\n  - *\"\342\200\242 If you still don\'t see it, resend the confirmation email.\"*\n\n#### **3. Real Resend API with Live Cooldown**\n- Integrated real `supabase.auth.resend({ type: \'signup\', email, options: { emailRedirectTo: window.location.origin } })`.\n- Implemented a 60-second reactive countdown timer (`RESEND IN 59s...`) to prevent rate-limit errors and spamming.\n- Returns clear feedback: `\"Confirmation email sent.\"` upon success, and friendly mapped messages upon error.\n\n#### **4. Confirmation Redirect & Lifecycle Detection**\n- Handled callback tokens and URL hashes (`#access_token=...&type=signup`) via `supabase.auth.onAuthStateChange`.\n- When the user lands back in HALFTIME from their verification email, the application:\n  - Displays the `EMAIL CONFIRMED` confirmation state and toast.\n  - Sanitizes the URL hash via `window.history.replaceState` to prevent stale tokens.\n  - Gracefully detects expired OTP tokens (`otp_expired`) and prompts the user to resend.\n\n#### **5. Friendly Error Mapping**\n- Raw Supabase API errors are translated into user-friendly messages:\n  - `email_not_confirmed` $\\rightarrow$ *\"Please confirm your email before signing in.\"*\n  - `invalid_credentials` $\\rightarrow$ *\"Incorrect email or password.\"*\n  - `rate_limit` / `429` $\\rightarrow$ *\"Too many attempts. Please wait a moment and try again.\"*\n  - `network_failure` $\\rightarrow$ *\"We couldn\'t reach HALFTIME authentication. Please check your connection and try again.\"*\n  - `user_already_exists` $\\rightarrow$ *\"An account with this email already exists. Please sign in instead.\"*\n\n---\n\n### **Authentication Verification Checklist**\n\n| # | Step | Expected Outcome | Verified |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: |\n| 1 | **Create new account** | Form submits to Supabase `signUp` with email & password | |\n| 2 | **Confirmation screen** | `CHECK YOUR EMAIL` modal appears with target email & instructions | |\n| 3 | **Unconfirmed sign-in attempt** | Shows `EMAIL NOT CONFIRMED` with `[ RESEND CONFIRMATION EMAIL ]` | |\n| 4 | **Resend button** | Invokes `supabase.auth.resend` and initiates a 60s cooldown timer | |\n| 5 | **Email redirect** | User returns from email, hash is cleanly processed, shows `EMAIL CONFIRMED` | |\n| 6 | **Sign in & Dashboard** | User enters credentials and loads private RLS-protected workspace | |\n| 7 | **Sign out & Sign back in** | Session terminates cleanly; sign-in restores isolated project data | |"
    thinking: "**Analyzing Sign-up Flow**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the sign-up process, specifically the `supabase.auth.signUp` function. I\'ve noted the check for confirmation requirements (`!data.session`) and how it prevents treating the user as logged in when confirmation is needed. This is the core logic I\'m drilling down on.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "The Supabase email confirmation user experience for **HALFTIME** has been updated to provide a clear, guidance-oriented authentication flow while preserving Supabase Auth and Row Level Security rules.\n\n---\n\n### **Overview of the Implemented Authentication Flow**\n\n```\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202   SIGN UP    \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Enter email & password (min 6 chars)\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202CREATE ACCOUNT\342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Supabase auth.signUp with emailRedirectTo\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202 CHECK YOUR EMAIL \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Dedicated confirmation screen with email badge,\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230     webmail direct link, spam checklist & resend cooldown\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202 USER CONFIRMS    \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Clicks verification link in email\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202 EMAIL CONFIRMED  \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Redirected back to HALFTIME (cleans hash, verifies session)\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202   SIGN IN    \342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Verified login with password\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n       \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202HALFTIME DASHBOARD\342\224\202 \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Loads user-isolated projects via Postgres RLS\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n```\n\n---\n\n### **Key Improvements & Implementation Details**\n\n#### **1. Sign-Up Success State (`CHECK YOUR EMAIL`)**\n- Upon calling `supabase.auth.signUp`, HALFTIME inspects `data.session`. When confirmation is required by Supabase, the user is **not** prematurely treated as logged in.\n- The interface automatically transitions to the dedicated confirmation screen:\n  - **Heading:** `CHECK YOUR EMAIL`\n  - **Message:** *\"We\'ve created your HALFTIME account. Please confirm your email address using the link we sent you before signing in.\"*\n  - **Email Badge:** Displays the target email address in a high-contrast monospace container.\n  - **Action Controls:**\n    - `[ OPEN EMAIL ]` / `[ OPEN GMAIL ]` / `[ OPEN OUTLOOK ]`: Smart domain detection opens the user\'s webmail provider in a new tab.\n    - `[ RESEND CONFIRMATION EMAIL ]`: Triggers the live Supabase resend endpoint with an active cooldown timer.\n    - `[ BACK TO SIGN IN ]`: Returns to the sign-in form.\n\n#### **2. Clear Instructions & Unconfirmed Sign-In State**\n- If an unconfirmed user attempts to sign in:\n  - Detects the `email_not_confirmed` error from Supabase.\n  - Replaces raw technical errors with a dedicated `EMAIL NOT CONFIRMED` view stating: *\"Please confirm your email address before signing in.\"*\n  - Provides instant access to `[ RESEND CONFIRMATION EMAIL ]` and `[ TRY AGAIN ]`.\n- Includes an instruction panel:\n  - *\"Didn\'t receive it?\"*\n  - *\"\342\200\242 Check your spam or junk folder.\"*\n  - *\"\342\200\242 If you still don\'t see it, resend the confirmation email.\"*\n\n#### **3. Real Resend API with Live Cooldown**\n- Integrated real `supabase.auth.resend({ type: \'signup\', email, options: { emailRedirectTo: window.location.origin } })`.\n- Implemented a 60-second reactive countdown timer (`RESEND IN 59s...`) to prevent rate-limit errors and spamming.\n- Returns clear feedback: `\"Confirmation email sent.\"` upon success, and friendly mapped messages upon error.\n\n#### **4. Confirmation Redirect & Lifecycle Detection**\n- Handled callback tokens and URL hashes (`#access_token=...&type=signup`) via `supabase.auth.onAuthStateChange`.\n- When the user lands back in HALFTIME from their verification email, the application:\n  - Displays the `EMAIL CONFIRMED` confirmation state and toast.\n  - Sanitizes the URL hash via `window.history.replaceState` to prevent stale tokens.\n  - Gracefully detects expired OTP tokens (`otp_expired`) and prompts the user to resend.\n\n#### **5. Friendly Error Mapping**\n- Raw Supabase API errors are translated into user-friendly messages:\n  - `email_not_confirmed` $\\rightarrow$ *\"Please confirm your email before signing in.\"*\n  - `invalid_credentials` $\\rightarrow$ *\"Incorrect email or password.\"*\n  - `rate_limit` / `429` $\\rightarrow$ *\"Too many attempts. Please wait a moment and try again.\"*\n  - `network_failure` $\\rightarrow$ *\"We couldn\'t reach HALFTIME authentication. Please check your connection and try again.\"*\n  - `user_already_exists` $\\rightarrow$ *\"An account with this email already exists. Please sign in instead.\"*\n\n---\n\n### **Authentication Verification Checklist**\n\n| # | Step | Expected Outcome | Verified |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: |\n| 1 | **Create new account** | Form submits to Supabase `signUp` with email & password | |\n| 2 | **Confirmation screen** | `CHECK YOUR EMAIL` modal appears with target email & instructions | |\n| 3 | **Unconfirmed sign-in attempt** | Shows `EMAIL NOT CONFIRMED` with `[ RESEND CONFIRMATION EMAIL ]` | |\n| 4 | **Resend button** | Invokes `supabase.auth.resend` and initiates a 60s cooldown timer | |\n| 5 | **Email redirect** | User returns from email, hash is cleanly processed, shows `EMAIL CONFIRMED` | |\n| 6 | **Sign in & Dashboard** | User enters credentials and loads private RLS-protected workspace | |\n| 7 | **Sign out & Sign back in** | Session terminates cleanly; sign-in restores isolated project data | |"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 412124507
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
